<title>USA: TABLE - GRC Intl Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GRC Intl Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.37     loss	 $1.80</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,451     loss	16,650</p>
<p> Revs			31,251		   31,236</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,422		    9,250</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.87     loss	 $1.92</p>
<p> Net loss		  17,750     loss	17,637</p>
<p> Revs		     117,599		  117,016</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,514		    9,172</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Periods ended June 30.</p>
<p>Q4 operating profit $1.5 million vs operating loss $1.8 million.</p>
<p>Q4 income from continuing operations $3.5 million vs loss $2.1 million. Income per share from continuing operations was $0.37 vs loss $0.23.</p>
<p>Income from continuing operations in 1997 Q4 was $1.1 million before $2.4 million income tax benefit. Excluding the the effect of the benefit, pro forma earnings per share on a primary basis for the quarter would have been $0.11.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 includes loss from discontinued operations of $14.6 million.</p>
</text>
